.sp 
.SH Documentation
.sp 
.nf 
\f[CB]type\fR t
.fi 
.br 
.ti +2
The functor is defined inline, so there is no path for odoc to apply: it has to bind the functor to a module first, as it does for every include functor in a signature\.
.nf 
.sp 
\f[CB]type\fR included = t
